  "structure": {
    "block_count": 44,
    "blocks": [
      {
        "block_id": "block_000000",
        "block_index": 0,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h1",
        "text": "How to Safely Lift Your Older Baby or Toddler During Pregnancy",
        "text_sha256": "9b565e436979667ad9fbcf1022f2769898b556ad02f96a233307840de476ab79",
        "word_count": 11
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000001",
        "block_index": 1,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "by Heidi Murkoff , author of What to Expect When You're Expecting.",
        "text_sha256": "fe0f379871761f84993fc97638e1be60dfaee98ef922ce30fb241d275bfed786",
        "word_count": 12
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000002",
        "block_index": 2,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Updates to copy, sources, and formatting.",
        "text_sha256": "2bf448333081ffc8549a45a6c4b7fc711ee4b93575f0fffd3c4a6212c13581c2",
        "word_count": 6
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000003",
        "block_index": 3,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Pregnant woman holding toddler",
        "text_sha256": "3d91c06912eafd58bc8b32a65fc395f081d38c8c17165d8e8105f14693b729b9",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000004",
        "block_index": 4,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "\"People keep telling me that I shouldn't be picking up my son (who is 25 pounds and just a baby himself) while I'm pregnant. But I can't avoid it. What should I do?\"",
        "text_sha256": "187c7522f658ccc01621aa522ce79734248d58aa894c3ae7bc0187e5726e2ca1",
        "word_count": 33
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000005",
        "block_index": 5,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "If you're a mom-to-be with younger children at home , it can be understandably challenging — if not impossible — to completely avoid lifting your little ones while you're growing another little one inside you.",
        "text_sha256": "26c7b9febcb90a8dfc2822a6351107b0f8692b696b33409f179897af69184e36",
        "word_count": 35
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000006",
        "block_index": 6,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "As long as your doctor hasn't restricted your activity (or your lifting), it's not a problem to lift your big baby, suggests data from the American College of Obstetricians & Gynecologists (ACOG) . Just get clearance for baby lift-off from your doctor first. And always let your practitioner know if you experience any pain or spotting after lifting a younger child.",
        "text_sha256": "04200f11f3ea7b0b25b15e927321042e7ec00f362f47f3d519439ab3805e2363",
        "word_count": 61
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000007",
        "block_index": 7,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Key Takeaways",
        "text_sha256": "cc3f7f0f4513969e418b56fb93ec0876fd96dd6498395b04301f70dbddff8a45",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000008",
        "block_index": 8,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "If your provider hasn’t restricted lifting , it’s generally okay to pick up your older child — just get the green light first.",
        "text_sha256": "588d935dbd96bc4c2185f491789f127dc2f4d98de63742a6bf22efe25fb6b696",
        "word_count": 23
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000009",
        "block_index": 9,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Use safe form: wide stance, butt tucked, bend at the knees, and lift slowly with your legs (not your back).",
        "text_sha256": "66530ad7d73a0858fec50d740a6cf472c72dcb973b2002caee96aca8e0f42d0a",
        "word_count": 20
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000010",
        "block_index": 10,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Stop and call your provider if you have pain or spotting, and switch to seated snuggles if your back protests.",
        "text_sha256": "f6876ca87391b5c2addbc367b63f88bb3e20495335388c8112fab62d6e03404c",
        "word_count": 20
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000011",
        "block_index": 11,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "“I’m a 3rd time mom and I have a 2-year-old daughter (will be 3 in March) and a 1-year-old daughter (will be 2 in May), and I’m a stay-at-home mom, so I carry them 24/7,” reports What to Expect Community mom G1rlM4m4.",
        "text_sha256": "079c631895412fedb14edece2a846545282b1ce047313c3f903a9c8fe3eb29fd",
        "word_count": 42
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000012",
        "block_index": 12,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Juggling pregnancy with a big kid (or two)? Get the What to Expect app for guidance and support.",
        "text_sha256": "0f8716ec5cbbc5aabb013a566727c4ffb3649632b7695f62a3891fcae95416e5",
        "word_count": 18
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000013",
        "block_index": 13,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "As long as your lifting is unrestricted, make sure you're doing it in a way that doesn't hurt your back. To safely pick up a bigger baby or younger toddler during pregnancy, keep these steps in mind before you lift:",
        "text_sha256": "ba51a912db986ab75ee9f8078e6f1ecfffe3b102f2855066521284bda258866e",
        "word_count": 40
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000014",
        "block_index": 14,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Stabilize your body first by assuming a wide stance (feet shoulder-width apart).",
        "text_sha256": "41537b9dad376fb9d92d0651e1c60a09bd4181ae0044b3757f79ee94fe99f8b4",
        "word_count": 12
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000015",
        "block_index": 15,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Tuck your buttocks in.",
        "text_sha256": "3e5463b22c408184c77fa26e7defeb4c65a365f16a0d521b30029b4690716e7e",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000016",
        "block_index": 16,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Bend at the knees, not at the waist, and lift (not abruptly) with legs rather than your back.",
        "text_sha256": "762780925fb80d55ac1a397503733be5b44f4b4a1e6273cfd0faf68a10bc5221",
        "word_count": 18
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000017",
        "block_index": 17,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "If lifting your younger child does hurt your back, blame your back — not the baby (no need to set the stage for sibling rivalry just yet!). Or just do more sitting and cuddling!",
        "text_sha256": "a6b815141c3b0f6d208a50273a1c53473258c8f4cca6ce4cdca9539e1731f649",
        "word_count": 34
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000018",
        "block_index": 18,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Good luck,",
        "text_sha256": "025f1bc4e552180371e36b8972e979b175a33ae7a72003900fd0ce28611e29d9",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000019",
        "block_index": 19,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Heidi Murkoff",
        "text_sha256": "6f05d1b1394d028842497499fff96bffb14810fb4a10d1a23a1ef1b82a72292e",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000020",
        "block_index": 20,
        "block_type": "blockquote",
        "tag": "blockquote",
        "text": "What to Expect the First Year , 3rd edition, Heidi Murkoff. WhatToExpect.com, 8 Tips for Managing Pregnancy With a Toddler , May 2021. American College of Obstetricians & Gynecologists, Physical Activity and Exercise During Pregnancy and the Postpartum Period , April 2020, reaffirmed 2023. Mayo Clinic, Back Pain During Pregnancy: 7 Tips for Relief , March 2024. National Institutes of Health, National Library of Medicine, Provisional Recommended Weight Limits for Manual Lifting During Pregnancy , February 2014.",
        "text_sha256": "2bda9988a54d7da90c1bc3955e1f90e3687d22acd3ab19bcd7b9289e1afd7724",
        "word_count": 77
      },
