        "text": "8 Tips for Managing Pregnancy With a Toddler Fact Checked by Jill Malter",
        "text_sha256": "4446a3c0c6f89008fecb382584d2882997998ab301b45e074c64b97f5d4e48ad",
        "word_count": 13
      },
      {
